   muted #A6C4E5, accent #6375EC). Light-theme variants keep the miniapp's
   theme=='light' conditional-class mechanism with a minimal rule set. Sizes converted
   rpx→px (÷2) where fixed; percentage bars unchanged. No new colors invented. */

.uh-root { flex: 1; background-color: #0B1C2E; }
